// hello thanks for checking this out. check out my other stuff at perchance.org/sollado
//preisdential notes:
filter = {import:filter-list-plugin}
title
  BREAKING NEWS ^0.08333333333333333
  {{A-Z}^26| }REAKING NEWS
  B{{A-Z}^26| }EAKING NEWS
  BR{{A-Z}^26| }AKING NEWS
  BRE{{A-Z}^26| }KING NEWS
  BREA{{A-Z}^26| }ING NEWS
  BREAK{{A-Z}^26| }NG NEWS
  BREAKI{{A-Z}^26 |}G NEWS
  BREAKIN{{A-Z}^26| } NEWS
  BREAKING {{A-Z}^26| }EWS
  BREAKING N{{A-Z}^26| }WS
  BREAKING NE{{A-Z}^26| }S
  BREAKING NEW{{A-Z}^26| }
output
  [nation.sentenceCase] declares war on [nation].
    // Uzbekistan declares war on Nepal.
  The [a = nation.selectOne, a.getName]-[b = nation.selectOne, b.getName] war ends with {[a.getName]|[b.getName]} winning. 
    // The Mozambique-India war ends with Mozambique winning.
  The [a = nation.selectOne, a.title] of [a.getName], [a.pres], has been {captured|killed} by the [group].
    // The president of France, Emmanuel Macron, has been captured by the BYSO.
  An attack perpetrated by [nation] in [a = nation.selectOne, a.city], [a.getName.titleCase] kills {0-1000} and injures {0-1000}.
    // An attack perpetrated by Uruguay in Vila Nova de Gaia, Portugal kills 306 and injures 828.
  [a = nation.selectOne, a.title.sentenceCase] of [a.getName], [a.pres], {condemns|supports} [nation]'s invasion of [nation].
    // Transitioning president of Guinea-Bissau, Horta Ha Man, supports Canada's invasion of Laos.
  [nation.sentenceCase] gives [amount] [item.pluralForm] to [nation] to support their war against [nation].
    // Bulgaria gives 6,831,174 inchworms to Dominica to support their war against Liechtenstein.
  [nation.sentenceCase] starts development for their "Super-[item.titleCase]", which they plan to finish by {2027-2050}. 
    // Barbados starts development for their "Super-Individually Wrapped Rice Grain", which they plan to finish by 2044.
  [nation.sentenceCase]'s Super-[item.titleCase] comes out {un|}successful.
    // Saint Vincent and the Grenadines's Super-Feather comes out unsuccessful.
  [nation.sentenceCase] {stops|starts} shipping [item.pluralForm] to [nation] as part of a trade war.
    // Georgia stops shipping woolless heavy loud stubern weak slow sheep that projectile vomits a fluid witht the viscosity of maple syrup and smells like sulfur constantly and has no fat so you would throw up if you tried to eat its to Hungary as part of a trade war.
  [a = nation.selectOne, a.title.sentenceCase] of [a.getName], [a.pres], dies of natural causes.
    // King of Morocco, Mohammed VI, dies of natural causes.
  [a = nation.selectOne, a.title.sentenceCase] of [a.getName], [a.pres], says "{A-Z}[spam.selectMany(1,30)]", causing nationwide {support|outrage|confusion}.
    // Prime minister of Thailand, Anutin Charnvirakul, says "Jd yifh", causing nationwide outrage.
  The [group] has been destroyed by the [a = nation.selectOne, a.people] army. 
    // The RKGU has been destroyed by the Palauan army.
  [a = nation.selectOne, a.getName.sentenceCase]'s [a.title] [a.pres] and [b = nation.selectOne, b.getName]'s [b.title] [b.pres] meet in [c = nation.selectOne, c.city], [c.getName] to discuss {[item] trade|the [nation]-[nation] war}.
    // Azerbaijan's president Ilham Aliyev and Thailand's prime minister Anutin Charnvirakul meet in Gisenyi, Rwanda to discuss the Malawi-North Korea war.
  A battle between [nation] and [a = nation.selectOne, a.getName] planned in [a.city] has been postponed due to {a} [disaster].
    // A battle between Botswana and Ghana planned in Tamale has been postponed due to an avalanche.
  A {ship|plane} from [nation] carrying {2-1000} {[item.pluralForm]|people} has been shot down by [nation.selectOne.people] forces{ as it was mistaken as an enemy|}.
    //A plane from Azerbaijan carrying 669 ships has been shot down by Djiboutian forces as it was mistaken as an enemy.
  [a = nation.selectOne, a.getName.sentenceCase] stops using the [item]. "It's no longer {1600-2025}" says [a.title] [a.pres].
    // Sao Tome and Principe stops using the stick. "It's no longer 1910" says prime minister Americo Ramos.
  [a = nation.selectOne, a.getName.sentenceCase] demands [b = nation.selectOne, b.getName] to investigate violence against [a.people] people in [b.city].
    // Indonesia demands Lebanon to investigate violence against Indonesian people in Sidon.
  [nation.sentenceCase] arrests {2-50} people for being connected to the [group].
    // Austria arrests 47 people for being connected to the EUIL.
  [a = nation.selectOne, a.getName.sentenceCase]'s [a.title] [a.pres] says "I really {like|hate} [item.pluralForm]". 
    // Ghana's president John Mahama says "I really hate fish".
  [a = nation.selectOne, a.title.sentenceCase] [a.pres] says "HELL NO" to the offer to have the MV Hondius disembark in [a.getName].
    // President Jose Antonio Kast says "HELL NO" to the offer to have the MV Hondius disembark in Chile.
  [item.sentenceCase] production halts in [a = nation.selectOne, a.getName] after a major factory in [a.city] was destroyed in a [disaster].
    // Cannon production halts in Latvia after a major factory in Jurmala was destroyed in a flood.
  Protests start in [a = nation.selectOne, a.city] against [a.getName]'s invasion of [nation].
    // Protests start in La Chorrera against Panama's invasion of Mauritius.
  [a = nation.selectOne, a.getName.sentenceCase] destroys {a} [item] factory in [b = nation.selectOne, b.city], [b.getName], killing {1-50} people and injuring {1-50} others.
    // Spain destroys an individually wrapped rice grain factory in Micoud, Saint Lucia, killing 32 people and injuring 45 others.
  [a = nation.selectOne, a.getName.sentenceCase]'s [a.title] [a.pres] makes [nation] and [nation] have a ceasefire.
    // Monaco's sovereign prince Albert II makes Italy and Angola have a ceasefire.
  A [person] in [a = nation.selectOne, a.city] finds {2-100} [b = item.selectOne, b.pluralForm] dating back to {1600-2025}. It was sold to the National [b.titleCase] Museum of [a.getName] for $[amount].
    //A person in La Chorrera finds 56 dollars dating back to 1637. It was sold to the National Dollar Museum of Panama for $179,852.
  A [person] in [a = nation.selectOne, a.city], [a.getName] hijacks a {boat|plane|train|car} carrying {2-1000} [item.pluralForm].
    // A person in Izmir, Turkiye hijacks a train carrying 906 cannons.
  [a = nation.selectOne, a.title.sentenceCase] of [a.getName], [a.pres], gets {a shoe thrown at them during a speech in [a.city]|thrown up on by [b = nation.selectOne, b.title] [b.pres] during a speech in [b.city], [b.getName]}.
    //President of Turkmenistan, Serdar Berdimuhamedow, gets a shoe thrown at them during a speech in Balkanabat.
  A [a = person.selectOne] from [b = nation.selectOne, b.city], [b.getName] sues [c = item.selectOne, c.titleCase] Inc. for $[amount] after [a.they] tripped on {a} [c]. The case was dismissed because [c.titleCase] Inc. actually sold [machine.pluralForm].
    // A man from Sanna, Yemen sues Keychain Inc. for $2,904 after he tripped on a keychain. The case was dismissed because Keychain Inc. actually sold garbadge disposal units.
  A battle between [a = nation.selectOne, a.getName] and [b = nation.selectOne, b.getName] has been canceled because the [a.people] warship landed in a small [nation.selectOne.people] town called [c = b.city.selectOne], instead of [c], [b.getName].
    // A battle between Norway and Yemen has been canceled because the Norwegian warship landed in a small Malaysian town called Aden, instead of Aden, Yemen.
  The [nation.selectOne.people] economy has been getting {better|worse}. 
    // The Togan economy has been getting better.
  Popular store {[item.titleCase]Mart|[machine.titleCase]World} {opens its first|closes its last} [a = nation.selectOne, a.people] store in [a.city].
    // Popular store LockerWorld opens its first Estonian store in Tartu.
  [a = nation.selectOne, a.city], [a.getName] has been captured by [nation.selectOne.people] forces.
    // Choibalsan, Mongolia has been captured by Norwegian forces.
  {A} [a = nation.selectOne, a.people] [person] got crushed by a falling [machine] at {a} {[item.titleCase]Mart|[machine.titleCase]World} in [a.city] after a shelf broke.  
    // A Malawian man got crushed by a falling kitchen hood at a DroneMart in Blantyre after a shelf broke.
  [a = item.selectOne, a.titleCase] Inc. tries selling [a] flavored baby food. Comes out unsuccessful.
    // Gun Inc. tries selling gun flavored baby food. Comes out unsuccessful.
  Residents of [a = nation.selectOne, a.city], [a.getName] report {[item.pluralForm]|[machine.pluralForm]} falling from the sky.
    // Residents of Khan Yunis, Palestine report folders falling from the sky.
  The WHO reports {a} [sick] epidemic in [nation] and [nation].
    // The WHO reports a MERS epidemic in Bahrain and Guinea.
  [a = nation.selectOne, a.people] business [place] celebrates their {1-500} year anniversary. 
    // German business Money Slammer celebrates their 313 year anniversary.
  {A} [nation.selectOne.people] [person]'s restaurant known for their [food.titleCase]-[food.titleCase] {Sandwiches|Soup} celebrates their one millionth dollar.
    // A Seychellois person's restaurant known for their Bergamot-Custard Apple Soup celebrates their one millionth dollar.
  {A} [nation.selectOne.people] explorer returning from [nation] introduces {[food.pluralForm]|[sick]} to [person.selectOne.their] home country.
    // A South Sudanese explorer returning from Mozambique introduces cowpeas to her home country.
  {A} [nation.selectOne.people] [person] invents a better way to grow [food.pluralForm].
    // A Burkinabe person invents a better way to grow lentils.
  [a = nation.selectOne, '']{2-100} people were killed and {2-100} more injured after the [place] building in [a.city], [a.getName] collapsed.
    // 25 people were killed and 35 more injured after the 50% Off Stationary building in Bossaso, Somalia collapsed.
  A [a = person.selectOne] in [b = nation.selectOne, b.city], [b.getName] was hospitalized after [a.they] tried to swallow a whole [food].
    // A woman in Kaedi, Mauritania was hospitalized after she tried to swallow a whole soybean.
  The [a = nation.consumableList]-[a] war was won by [a], somehow.
    // The the United States-Afghanistan war was won by Mozambique, somehow.
  {A} [a = nation.selectOne, a.people] [person] found {a} [gem] deposit in [a.city].
    // An Omani person found a moissanite deposit in Salalah.
  A [a = person.selectOne] in [b = nation.selectOne, b.city], [b.getName] found out that the rock [a.they] had for {1-10} years was actually [gem], which [a.they] later sold for $[amount].
    // A man in Brisbane, Australia found out that the rock he had for 2 years was actually polyhalite, which he later sold for $7,494,073.
  {A} [gem] mine collapses in [a = nation.selectOne, a.city], [a.getName] killing {1-100} and injures {1-100}.
    // A poudretteite mine collapses in Monaco, Monaco killing 91 and injures 93.
  Shia LeBeouf claims another victim in [a = nation.selectOne, a.city], [a.getName].
    // Shia LeBeouf claims another victim in Karaj, Iran.
  {A} [a = nation.selectOne, a.people] [b = person.selectOne] is fired from [place] after [b.they] dropped $[amount] worth of [item.pluralForm].
    // A Mozambican man is fired from Rainforest Inc. after he dropped $34,385 worth of dollars.
  [a = nation.selectOne, '']A battle between [b = nation.selectOne, b.getName] and [c = nation.selectOne, c.getName] in [c.city] was cancelled after the [b.people] troops got bored halfway through the trip and stopped at the [place] in [a.city], [a.getName].
    // A battle between Mauritania and Kiribati in North Tarawa was cancelled after the Mauritanian troops got bored halfway through the trip and stopped at the Egg Hole In The Wall in Miskolc, Hungary.
  [nation.titleCase] develops a ballistic missile that destroys [loop.selectMany(2,10).joinItems(' ')] ballistic missiles.
    // Latvia develops a ballistic missile that destroys ballistic missiles that destroy ballistic missiles that destroy ballistic missiles that destroy ballistic missiles that destroy ballistic missiles that destroy ballistic missiles that destroy ballistic missiles.
  [a = nation.selectOne, a.title.sentenceCase] [a.pres] releases an album titled "The Trip to [place]", gets rated {1-10}/10 by [a.people]Tunes.
    // Prime minister Benjamin Netanyahu releases an album titled "The Trip to Iced Theater", gets rated 8/10 by IsraeliTunes.
  [a = nation.selectOne, '']{A} [b = nation.selectOne, b.people] [person] won a free [prize] in the [b.city] lottery. 
    // A Congolese woman won a free bowl of spinach-artichoke soup in the Pointe-Norie lottery.
  {A} [nation.selectOne.people] aircraft stops a [nation] flagged ship from going into the gulf of [nation].
    // A Tanzanian aircraft stops a Turkiye flagged ship from going into the gulf of the United States.
  Protests start in [a = nation.selectOne, a.city], [a.getName] for more rights for [nation.selectOne.people] diaspora.
    // Protests start in Mecca, Saudi Arabia for more rights for Mexican diaspora.
  {A} [a = nation.selectOne, a.people] [person] was sentenced to {1-120} year{s} in prison for [crime.selectUnique(1,9).joinItems(', ')], and [crime].
    // A Canadian person was sentenced to 120 years in prison for Possession by Restricted Persons, Bombing Matters, Narcotics Violations, Transmission of Wagering Information (Gambling), and Criminal Contempt of Court.
  [a = nation.selectOne, a.getName] makes [crime] {|il}legal {|again}.
    // Syria makes certification of checks (fraud) legal again.
  [a = nation.selectOne, '']{2-100} people killed and {2-100} injured after the [place] building in [a.city], [a.getName] {im|ex}ploded.
    // 61 people killed and 30 injured after the Jewel Homeless Shelter building in Gothenburg, Sweden exploded.
  The {[nation]|[nation.selectOne.people]} [thing.pluralForm.titleCase] beat the {[nation]|[nation.selectOne.people]} [thing.pluralForm.titleCase] in the World [sport.titleCase] Championship finale. [c = number.selectOne]-[d = number.selectOne][c == '6' && d == '9' ? '(nice)' : '']. [c == d ? '(they paid more)' : '']
    // The Andorra Bioties beat the Luxembourg Artisitc Gymnastics in the World Bmx Racing Championship finale. 7-6.
  {A} [a = nation.selectOne, a.people] [person] was injured while doing [sport] in [a.city].
    // An Azerbaijani woman was injured while doing BMX freestyle in Sumgait.
  [item.sentenceCase] prices in [a = nation.selectOne, a.getName] have {in|de}creased by {1-100}% in the past month due to the {[a.getName]-[nation]|[nation]-[a.getName]} war.
    // Dust speck prices in the United Arab Emirates have increased by 10% in the past month due to the Cambodia-the United Arab Emirates war.
  [a = nation.selectOne, '']A World [sport.titleCase] Championship match between the {[a.getName]|[a.people]} [thing.pluralForm.titleCase] and the {[nation]|[nation.selectOne.people]} [thing.pluralForm.titleCase] in [a.city] was cancelled halfway through due to {a} [disaster].
    // A World Artisitc Gymnastics Championship match between the San Marinese Heartland Viri and the Kyrgyzstan Moonstones in Domagnano was cancelled halfway through due to a meteror.
  Protests start in [a = nation.selectOne, a.getName] after the mayor of [a.city] tears down {2-50} buildings to build a new road.
    // Protests start in Mali after the mayor of Segou tears down 2 buildings to build a new road.
  [a  = nation.selectOne, a.getName] uses the [place] building in [a.city] to quarantine people with [sick].
    // Latvia uses the Publishing Corner building in Jelgava to quarantine people with q fever.
  [a = nation.selectOne, a.people] corporation {[item.titleCase]Mart|[machine.titleCase]World} steals the world's largest [item] collection from an old [person] with [sick] in [a.city], which was valued to be $[amount].
    // Honduras corporation Gold BarMart steals the world's largest gold bar collection from an old person with body lice in La Ceiba, which was valued to be $1,779,611.
  [sick.titleCase] vaccines are delivered to [a = nation.selectOne, a.city], [a.getName].
    // Cryptosporidiosis vaccines are delivered to Matagalpa, Nicaragua.
  [nation.selectOne.people] {[gem] mining|[food] farming} town [name.selectMany(3,10).joinItems('').titleCase] becomes the fastest growing city in the world, with an average growth of {1-1000} people a day.
    // Maltese groundnut farming town Rgr Temub becomes the fastest growing city in the world, with an average growth of 383 people a day.
  {A} [a = nation.selectOne, a.people] [b = food.selectOne] seller is arrested in [person.selectOne.their] mansion in [a.city] after telling people that [b.pluralForm] can cure [sick].
    // A Tuvaluan currants seller is arrested in her mansion in Fakaifu after telling people that currants can cure keratits.
  Protests start in [a = nation.selectOne, a.city] after the [a.people] goverment announced their plan to develop the [name.selectMany(3,10).joinItems('').titleCase] [biome].
    // Protests start in Casteries after the Saint Lucian goverment announced their plan to develop the Itayy Eji badlands.
  A blackout hits [a = nation.selectOne, a.getName] after a [b = person.selectOne] working at the [start.titleCase] Power Plant in [a.city] used the plant to charge [b.their] electric [machine].
    // A blackout hits Burundi after a woman working at the Information Power Plant in Ruyigi used the plant to charge her electric desk.
  CEO of {[item.titleCase]Mart|[machine.titleCase]World} [fullName] was assassinated in [a = nation.selectOne, a.city], [a.getName].
    // CEO of IronWorld Uoeoium Bulgarian was assassinated in Bissau, Guinea-Bissau.
  The assassin of [a = nation.selectOne, a.title] [a.pres], [fullName], was found in the [place] building in [a.city], [a.getName].
    // The assassin of prime minister Philip J. Pierre, G Sn McRamie, was found in the Mom & Pop​ To Buy building in Soufriere, Saint Lucia.
  Late [a = nation.selectOne, a.title] [a.pres] of [a.getName] comes back to life to serve another term.
    // Late prime minister Hun Manet of Cambodia comes back to life to serve another term.
  [a = nation.selectOne, a.title.sentenceCase] [a.pres] tried making [a.getName]ish to be the official language of [a.getName]. This was rejected because [a.getName]ish isn't a language. 
    // Prime minister Anwar Ibrahim tried making Malaysiaish to be the official language of Malaysia. This was rejected because Malaysiaish isn't a language.
  [letters.selectMany(3)] News was sued by the [a = nation.selectOne, a.people] government after revealing that [a.title] [a.pres] doesn't know how to use {a} [machine].
    // ISO News was sued by the Filipino government after revealing that president Bongbong Marcos doesn't know how to use a hole puncher.
  A battle between [a = nation.selectOne, a.getName] and [b = nation.selectOne, b.getName] in [a.city] was won by [c = winner.selectOne, c == 'a' ? a.getName : b.getName] after the [c == 'a' ? b.people : a.people] troops accidentally {angered|disturbed} a {beehive|wasp nest|yellow jacket hole}.
    // A battle between Belgium and Eswatini in Liege was won by Belgium after the Swazi troops accidentally angered a yellow jacket hole.
  [fullName] becomes mayor of [a = nation.selectOne, a.city], [a.getName].
    // Ioovcg Petl Hergeisa becomes mayor of Kloulklubed, Palau.
  The [letters.selectMany(3)] warns [nation.selectOne.people] youth to not try to eat [item.pluralForm].
    // The FWR warns Ethiopian youth to not try to eat warships.
  [a = nation.selectOne, a.people] serial killer [fullName] cries after having [person.selectOne.their] [toy] taken away in court.
    // Ukrainean serial killer Lme Mosquito cries after having his sand taken away in court.
  The [a = nation.selectOne, a.people] [item.titleCase] Party was dissolved after its president, [fullName], was arrested for [crime]. [a.noParties == true ? '(also because they don\'t have parties there )' : '']
    // The Bosotho Dollar Party was dissolved after its president, Uktgeunnai Lawn Mower, was arrested for retaliating against a witness, victim, or an informant.
  Backlash against [nation.selectOne.people] news channel [letters.selectMany(3)] News starts after reporter [fullName] says "{A-Z}[bleep.selectMany(2,5)]" live
    // Backlash against Sierra Leonean news channel TOO News starts after reporter Cakcifjwj Kenyan says "Y*****" live
  CEO of {[item.titleCase]Mart|[machine.titleCase]Word} [fullName] reveals that [a = person.selectOne.they] [a == 'they' ? 'make' : 'makes'] ${1-999} every second.
    // CEO of Staple RemoverWord Yuwll McOil reveals that he makes $544 every second.
  [a = nation.selectOne, a.people] [a.title] [a.pres] gets humiliated after trying to correct a {1-12} year old [person.selectOne.kid] that said [b = number.selectOne] [c = operator.selectOne] [d = number.selectOne] is [c == 'plus' ? b += d : b -= d].
    // Mexican president Claudia Sheinbaum gets humiliated after trying to correct a 12 year old kid that said 8 plus 8 is 16.
  [a = nation.selectOne, a.title.sentenceCase] [a.pres] was charged with {2-40} counts of [b = crime.selectOne]. <br><br> [b.sentenceCase] is legalized in [a.getName] and anyone arrested for it became free.
    // Prime minister Feleti Teo was charged with 5 counts of narcotics violations. Narcotics violations is legalized in Tuvalu and anyone arrested for it became free.
  [a = nation.selectOne, a.title.sentenceCase] [a.pres] forces [amount] [nation.selectOne.people] people to leave [a.getName].
    // King Hamad bin Isa Al Khalifa forces 894,346 Gabonese people to leave Bahrain.
  Bio[nation.selectOne.getName.titleCase] reports that the water levels in the [name.selectMany(3,15).joinItems('').titleCase] [biome.titleCase] have {ris|fall}en by {0-100}.{0-9}%.
    // BioGuatemala reports that the water levels in the Ekegiaruwk Forest have risen by 6.5%.
  {A} [nation.selectOne.people] [person] breaks the world record for [sport].
    // A Nigerian woman breaks the world record for wushu.
  [a = nation.selectOne, '']{A} [b = nation.selectOne, b.people] [person] was banned from the {[thing.titleCase]|{[item.titleCase]Mart|[machine.titleCase]World}} stadium in [a.city], [a.getName] after throwing {a} [item] at [a.people] [c = sport.selectOne] player [fullName] during the World [c.titleCase] Championship match between the [d = winner.selectOne, d == 'a' ? a.people : b.people] [thing.pluralForm.titleCase] and the [d == 'a' ? b.people : a.people] [thing.pluralForm.titleCase].
    // A Saint Lucian man was banned from the Computer stadium in Las Piedras, Uruguay after throwing a cabbage at Uruguayan snowboard player Ujaeam Usa Laser Pointer during the World Snowboard Championship match between the Saint Lucian Matches and the Uruguayan Kutnohorites.
  {A} [a = nation.selectOne, a.people] [b = binary.selectOne, ''] [c = person.selectOne] sues {[item.titleCase]Mart|[machine.titleCase]World} for $[amount] after <s> an employee attacked [c.them] with {a} [d = machine.selectOne] breaking [b == '1' ? '' : 'both of'] [c.their] {arm|leg|eye}[b == '1' ? '' : 's']</s> [c.they] tripped on a [d] that [c.they] dropped.
    // A Malagasy woman sues Dust SpeckMart for $1,413,081 after an employee attacked her with a LASER pointer breaking her arm she tripped on a LASER pointer that she dropped.
  [place] was bought by {[item.titleCase]Mart|[machine.titleCase]World} for $[amount].
    // Seafood Theater was bought by Individually Wrapped Rice GrainMart for $34,250.
  {A} [nation.selectOne.people] [person] sells {a} [food] that looks like {a} [item] for $[amount].[number.selectMany(2)].
    // An Azerbaijani person sells a black pepper that looks like a plane for $41,995.84.
  {A} [a = nation.selectOne, a.people] [person] who is allergic to [b = food.evaluateItem] sues [b.titleCase][end.titleCase] for $[amount] after having an allergic reaction to their complimentary [b] [dish].
    // A Naoerian man who is allergic to trefoils sues Trefoil​ Fast Food for $9,844,328 after having an allergic reaction to their complimentary trefoil fries.
  {A} [a = nation.selectOne, a.people] [b = person.selectOne] walks all the way from [b.their] hometown of [a.city] to [b = nation.selectOne, b.city], [b.getName] to protest the lack of [sick] research.
    // A Bosotho man walks all the way from his hometown of Maseru to Port Vila, Vanuatu to protest the lack of COVID-19 research.
  [a = nation.selectOne, '']Rumours arise that the [place] building in [a.city], [a.getName] has the ghost of [nation.selectOne.people] conquestador [fullName] who was kiled there in the {1300-1800} Battle of [item.pluralForm.titleCase].
    // Rumours arise that the The Museum Of For All To Enjoy building in Nonthaburi, Thailand has the ghost of Maldivian conquestador Mx Ciu Ooct Fencing who was kiled there in the 1673 Battle of Cabbages.
  The [a = nation.selectOne, a.people] army invades the [b = nation.selectOne, b.getName] claimed [name.selectMany(3,15).joinItems('').titleCase] [biome.titleCase], leading to [b.getName] {keep|los}ing the land.
    // The Tajik army invades the Tanzania claimed Q Eirvh Badlands, leading to Tanzania keeping the land.
  {A} [item] fell out of an airplane, yet survived the {1-1000} foot fall, landing in pile of [food.pluralForm] at a farm in [a = nation.selectOne, a.city], [a.getName].
    // A drone fell out of an airplane, yet survived the 276 foot fall, landing in pile of hybrid maizes at a farm in Constatine, Algeria.
  [a = nation.selectOne, a.people] troops raid the [place] building in [b = nation.selectOne, b.city], [b.getName] as it was a hideout of a gang know as The [item.pluralForm.titleCase].
    // South Sudanese troops raid the Welcome To The Helpers building in Nassue, the Bahamas as it was a hideout of a gang know as The Bombs.
  A little [nation.selectOne.people] cat walks across the frozen [name.selectMany(3,15).joinItems('').titleCase] River.
    // A little Tunisian cat walks across the frozen Voklq River.
  [a = nation.selectOne, '']{A} [sick] epidemic breaks out of the [place] building in [a.city], [a.getName].
    // A rubella epidemic breaks out of the Super High School building in Mixco, Guatemala.
  {A} [a = nation.selectOne, a.people] [a = person.selectOne] was murdered by having [a.their] [food] [dish] poisoned by [a.their] ex-[person.selectOne.lover].
    // A Qatari man was murdered by having his broo sorghum cabbage poisoned by his ex-spouse.
  [a = nation.selectOne, ''] [start.titleCase] Foods Inc. is sued for $[amount] after {a} [a.people] [b = person.selectOne] in [a.city] {got [c = burn.selectOne][c == 1 ? 'st' : c == 2 ? 'nd' : c == 3 ? 'rd' : 'th'] degree burns^4|died} after [b.their] microwave exploded while [b.they] [b.they == 'they' ? 'were' : 'was'] cooking their "Microwavable [food.titleCase] [dish.titleCase]". 
    // Battle Foods Inc. is sued for $5,345,451 after a Vatican woman in the Vatican City City got 2nd degree burns after her microwave exploded while she was cooking their "Microwavable Cress Boil".
  [a = nation.selectOne, a.people] [sport.sentenceCase] player [fullName] was traded from the [a.city.titleCase] [thing.pluralForm.titleCase] to the [a.city.titleCase] [thing.pluralForm.titleCase]. 
    // Cambodian Short track speed skating player Ence C G Mr Potato Head was traded from the Poipet Cabbages to the Siem Reap Gonorrheas.
  [a = nation.selectOne, a.people] rapper [fullName] gets arested for [b = crime.selectOne.evaluateItem]. It was only discovered that it was [c = person.selectOne, c.them] after [c.they] released [c.their] song "That Time on [d = month.selectOne] [d.day] {1996-2025} at {1-12}:{0-5}{0-9} {AM|PM} I got away with [b] at [number.selectMany(3)] [thing.titleCase] Ave, [a.city]" 
    // Colombian rapper Bdo Ni Cabbage gets arested for bond default. It was only discovered that it was him after he released his song "That Time on October 30 2021 at 5:09 AM I got away with bond default at 649 Big Wheel Ave, Cartagena"
  [a = nation.selectOne, a.getName]'s [a.title] [a.pres] makes [b = month.selectOne] [b.day] National [thing.titleCase] Day.
    // Portugal's prime minister Luis Montenegro makes January 29 National Aid Kit Day.
  [a = nation.selectOne, a.getName]'s [a.title] [a.pres] says "my favorite number is [number + number - number * number / number]".
    // Moldova's prime minister Alexandru Munteanu says "my favorite number is 14".
  [nation.selectOne.people] linguist [fullName] invents a new letter that sounds like {a-z} and {a-z} being said at the same time.
    // Timorese linguist E Fbda Landmine invents a new letter that sounds like b and v being said at the same time.
  [a = nation.selectOne, a.people] [thing.titleCase] player [fullName] becomes the MVP of the World [sport.titleCase] Championship.
    // Solomon Islander Archery player A Iwj McJock Itch becomes the MVP of the World Handball Championship.
  In recent [a = nation.selectOne, a.people] news: EVERYONE IN [a.city.upperCase] IS DEAD.
    // In recent Macedonian news: EVERYONE IN TETOVO IS DEAD.
  [fullName], a member of the [nation.selectOne.people] [thing.pluralForm.titleCase] becomes MVP of the World [sport.titleCase] Championship.
    // Vpw Synke Cuban, a member of the Djiboutian Radio Flyers becomes MVP of the World Artistic Swimming Championship.
  [a = nation.selectOne, a.people] mobster [fullName], who killed around {10-100} people, was arrested in [a.city] for [crime].
    // Equatorial Guinean mobster Mt Q Kakaq Athletics, who killed around 27 people, was arrested in Bata for antitrust.
  [a = nation.selectOne, a.pres] wins the best [a.title] of [a.getName] award with {101-1500}% of the votes.
    // Benjamin Netanyahu wins the best prime minister of Israel award with 274% of the votes.
  A {1-200} carrat [gem] was found in [a = nation.selectOne, a.city], [a.getName].
    // A 5 carrat Mali gernet was found in Mafeteng, Lesotho.
  [a = nation.selectOne, ''][start.titleCase] Candles Inc. makes [thing] scented candles.
    // Learning Candles Inc. makes Mafeteng scented candles.
  Residents of [a = nation.selectOne, a.city], [a.getName] report a UFO, it was later discovered to be {a} [item] that was accidentally launched into the air while two people were playing [sport].
    // Residents of Warsaw, Poland report a UFO, it was later discovered to be a stick that was accidentally launched into the air while two people were playing korfball.
  [a = nation.selectOne, '']{A} [b = nation.selectOne, b.people] immigrant living in in [a.city] was expelled from [start.titleCase] {Elementary|Middle|High} School for not eating their [food] [dish] "like {a} [a.people] person".
    // An American immigrant living in in Oulu was expelled from Money Middle School for not eating their apple cereal "like a Finnish person".
  [a = nation.selectOne, a.title.sentenceCase] [a.pres] denies that [a.getName] ever took part in the [nation.selectOne.people] genocide.
    // Co-president Daniel Ortega denies that Nicaragua ever took part in the North Korean genocide.
  [a = nation.selectOne, ''] [start.titleCase] Foods Inc. was sued for $[amount] after [sick] was found in their canned [food.pluralForm].
    // Information Foods Inc. was sued for $7,339,218 after giardiasis was found in their canned flax.
  [a = nation.selectOne, '']A {small|large} plane crashes into the [place] building in [a.city], [a.getName] killing {1-100} and injuring {1-100} more.
    // A large plane crashes into the Out Of Order Homeless Shelter building in Vieux Fort, Saint Lucia killing 75 and injuring 71 more.
  [nation.titleCase] Airlines flight [number.selectMany(3)]{A-Z} disapears with {2-400} people abrod.
    // France Airlines flight 675B disapears with 271 people abrod.
  Protests start in [a = nation.selectOne, a.city], [a.getName] after [a.title] [a.pres]'s {prohibition|legalization} of [crime].
    // Protests start in Mar del Plata, Argentina after president Javier Milei's prohibition of false entries in records of interstate carriers.
  [a = nation.selectOne, a.title.sentenceCase] [a.pres] declares state of emergency in [a.getName] after {a} [disaster] hit [a.city].  
    // President Volodymyr Zelenskyy declares state of emergency in Ukraine after a flood hit Alupka.
  The [group] tries starting a coup against [a = nation.selectOne, a.title] [a.pres] of [a.getName].
    // The ZZWM tries starting a coup against president Faustin-Archange of the Central African Republic.
  [a = nation.selectOne, a.getName] finishes contruction for a supercomputer in the University of [a.city].
    // Bulgaria finishes contruction for a supercomputer in the University of Sofia.
  Tempurtues hit an average of {80-140}°F in [nation].
    // Tempurtues hit an average of 95°F in Ukraine.
  [a = nation.selectOne, a.title.sentenceCase] [a.pres] of [a.getName] renames [thing] to [a.people.lowerCase]bashi.
    // President Netumbo Nandi-Ndaitwah of Namibia renames Botswana to naibianbashi.
  In the [a = nation.selectOne, a.people] civil war, the [group] sets fire to the [place] building in [a.city], killing {0-100} and injuring {0-100}.
    // In the Burkinabe civil war, the VCUR sets fire to the Public.com building in Kaya, killing 58 and injuring 7.
  [a = nation.selectOne, ''] An [a.people] [b = person.selectOne] lights [b.them]selve on fire in [a.city] to protest the {prohibition|legalization} of [crime].
    // An Italian person lights themselve on fire in Turin to protest the prohibition of false declarations before grand jury or court.
  [a = nation.selectOne, a.getName] and [b = nation.selectOne, b.getName] sign a defence pack, making [b.getName] one of [a.getName]'s treaty-bound allies.
    // El Salvador and Fiji sign a defence pack, making Fiji one of El Salvador's treaty-bound allies.
  [a = nation.selectOne, ''] [b = hundred.selectOne] [b == '1' ? 'person is' : 'people are'] killed and [c = hundred.selectOne] [c == '1' ? 'other is' : 'others are'] injured after the [place] in [a.city], [a.getName] was bombed in a failed assaination attemp for visiting [d = nation.selectOne, d.people] [d.title] [d.pres].
    // 65 people are killed and 28 others are injured after the Cystal Tower​ Fridge Factory in Capitata, Paraguay was bombed in a failed assaination attemp for visiting Nepali prime minister Balendra Shah.
  [nation.titleCase] has been banned from the World [sport.titleCase] Championship due to their invovment in the [nation.selectOne.people] genocide.
    // Belarus has been banned from the World Powerboating Championship due to their invovment in the Mozambican genocide.
  [a = nation.selectOne, a.people] chain restaurant [b = dish.selectOne, b.titleCase] Hut delivers [food] [b] to the [start.titleCase] Space Station.
    // British chain restaurant Barbeque Hut delivers cashew barbeque to the Cystal Tower Space Station.
  [nation.titleCase] bans anyone from entering the country from [nation.titleCase] due to the [sick] epidemic.
    // Niger bans anyone from entering the country from Iceland due to the sporotrichosis epidemic.
  The remains of [nation.titleCase] Airlines flight [number.selectMany(3)]{A-Z} are found of the coast of 
    // The remains of Timor-leste Airlines flight 725M
